# Executor Layer Rules

- Can call git. **NO LLM calls allowed.**
- Only executes when user explicitly requests apply.

## Apply Strategy (v0.1)

- Generate a patch per commit containing only that commit's hunks.
- Stage via: `git apply --cached <patch>`
- Commit via: `git commit -m "<subject>" [-m "<body>"]`
- If any step fails:
  - Stop immediately.
  - Restore index to pre-apply snapshot.
  - Report which commit failed and why.
